# asset-curator-journal

Append-only findings log for `feat/asset-curator`. Each entry is
written when a worker (sub-agent or human) finishes a task. The
parent reads this on resume to know what's been discovered.

Format per entry:
```
## YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ · task-id · status · worker

<one-paragraph summary>

<artifacts written>

<open questions / drift-tuning notes>
```

---

## 2026-09-04T16:30:00Z · PLAN · created · hermes

Plan written. 3 stages, ~2.5 days. Uses existing HF Spaces
(kaidjuric/png-creator + kaidjuric/association) — the swarm
orchestrator pattern already proven.

Risk: HF free-tier Spaces sleep after 48h. First request after
wakeup is 30-60s. Need a `⏳ agent warming up…` badge in the UI.

Stage 1 ready to start.

Artifacts:
- .hermes/plans/asset-curator.md (the plan)
- .hermes/plans/asset-curator-state.json (machine-readable)
- .hermes/plans/asset-curator-journal.mdl (this file)
